{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"Kolro continues to stare forward as the other vampire finishes wrapping his leg. The Nos glances at Bo, and you recognize him as one of the 4 Vampires that were present when the first group explored the Sewers. Everyone turns (besides Kolro) as Malathor enters with Jigsaw.","created_at":"2021-07-28T18:58:22.723000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870017359824420874","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
